826: /****************************************************************************
827:  * Name: nxplayer_thread_playthread
828:  *
829:  *  This is the thread that reads the audio file file and enqueues /
830:  *  dequeues buffers to the selected and opened audio device.
831:  *
832:  ****************************************************************************/
