../logs/pjjuihj/2026-08-15/claude-code__f7b6f300-fb20-405b-b863-157a4f8b0cce.jsonl:63:{"schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "f7b6f300-fb20-405b-b863-157a4f8b0cce", "team_id": "contest2026_329_dela", "github_login": "pjjuihj", "tool": "claude-code", "seq": 62, "ts": "2026-08-15T06:19:01.181Z", "model": "mimo-v2.5-pro", "tokens_in": 531, "tokens_out": 687, "role": "tool", "tool_name": "Agent", "tool_call_id": "call_1c2f3498c3a146e99fb5ecc1", "input": {"description": "Research SF32LB52 SFBL boot issue", "prompt": "Research the SFBL boot issue on SiFli SF32LB52 (黄山派) development board. The board was successfully flashed but is stuck continuously outputting \"SFBL\" and not booting further.\n\nResearch these from PRIMARY SOURCES:\n\n1. **What is SFBL** on SiFli platforms - search the SiFli wiki:\n   - https://wiki.sifli.com - search for SFBL, bootloader, boot sequence\n   - Try: https://wiki.sifli.com/sfbl/index.html, https://wiki.sifli.com/boot/index.html\n   - Look for boot flow documentation: ROM bootloader → SFBL → application\n\n2. **Common causes of SFBL loop/stuck**:\n   - Incorrect flash layout or partition table\n   - Missing or corrupt application image\n   - Wrong boot configuration (boot pin, flash offset)\n   - Flash programming errors\n\n3. **SF32LB52 boot sequence**:\n   - ROM bootloader behavior\n   - SFBL (Second Stage Boot Loader) role\n   - How application is loaded\n   - Required flash layout\n\n4. **Fix/debug approaches**:\n   - How to check if application is correctly flashed at the right offset\n   - SFBL configuration options\n   - Recovery procedures\n   - Serial log analysis\n   - Flash tool (J-Link, OpenOCD, SiFli's own tool) correct usage\n\n5. **OpenVela boot on SF32LB52**:\n   - How OpenVela/NuttX boots on this platform\n   - Required binaries (bl2, fip, system image)\n   - Correct flash addresses\n\nTry these URLs:\n- https://wiki.sifli.com\n- https://github.com/OpenSiFli\n- https://github.com/nickel-lang or search for SiFli SDK docs\n- Search GitHub issues for \"SFBL stuck\" or \"SFBL loop\" on SiFli repos\n\nAlso check the local repo for any flash/boot related configs:\n- Look at /home/cmj/桌面/1/contest2026_329_dela/ for board configs, flash scripts, linker scripts\n- Check openvela-contest-official/ for boot configuration\n\nWrite findings to /home/cmj/桌面/1/docs/sf32lb52-sfbl-recovery.md with:\n- What SFBL is and the boot flow\n- Common causes of SFBL stuck\n- Step-by-step debugging and fix procedures\n- Sources cited as URLs", "run_in_background": true}, "output": null}
